  "name": "Roasted Brussels Sprouts and Butternut Squash",
  "subtitle": "Smoky, tender vegetables from one pan",
  "description": "Brussels sprouts and butternut squash are seasoned with olive oil and warm spices, then roasted until tender and lightly browned.",
